  "title": "Pizza on the Grill",
  "description": "Make pizza on the grill with this recipe that cooks homemade pizza dough on one side, then tops the grilled side with tomato sauce, basil, and plenty of cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-09-03T16:46:58-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-04-20T06:05:30-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT45M",
  "cook_time": "PT15M",
  "total_time": "PT180M",
  "yield": [
    "16",
    "2 grilled pizzas"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Dinner"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "Italian"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "Italian"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [
    "publisher-tested"
  ],
  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup warm water (110 degrees F/45 degrees C)",
    "1 (.25 ounce) package active dry yeast",
    "1 pinch white sugar",
    "3.3333332538605 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "2 teaspoons kosher salt",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "1 tablespoon chopped fresh basil",
    "0.5 cup olive oil",
    "1 teaspoon minced garlic",
    "0.25 cup tomato sauce, divided",
    "1 cup chopped tomatoes, divided",
    "0.25 cup sliced black olives, divided",
    "0.25 cup roasted red peppers, drained and chopped, divided",
    "2 cups shredded mozzarella cheese, divided",
    "4 tablespoons chopped fresh basil, divided"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YfK_JWl5c1bIVYUeb2fQz3mIyvk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14522-Pizza-On-The-Grill084-step1-e860fd63c5fc4b2e8730386d3c1a197b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14522/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the dough: Pour warm water into a large bowl; dissolve yeast and sugar in warm water. Let stand until yeast softens and begins to form a creamy foam, about 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H4XIXOEx8rXC-NpevHgPS1SZbvE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14522-Pizza-On-The-Grill085-step2-251baa077a9f4f239aae5f380b778a94.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14522/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in flour, 1 tablespoon olive oil, and salt until dough pulls away from the sides of the bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/R_2StKKGT2xnqfKITlFWso5sR7k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14522-Pizza-On-The-Grill086-step3-9b0c2e734c3247b097cd3973bd25eb2e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14522/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn onto a lightly floured surface. Knead until smooth, about 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8eqTcEuCCSVYwA0pb4z_PeFVph4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14522-Pizza-On-The-Grill087-step4-764959af4c1e44b5998bcb56e7441ac0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14522/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place dough in a well-oiled bowl and cover with a damp cloth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cDIAMlCFTk_SD1CrGyS7_w3QweY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14522-Pizza-On-The-Grill088-step5-67e5ec8aa52245f0a271a6672e89c909.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14522/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Set aside to rise until doubled, about 1 hour. Punch down; knead in garlic and basil. Set aside to rise for 1 more hour, or until doubled again.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ObOwO-P1179joQ7-tFld8iANiFw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14522-Pizza-On-The-Grill091-step8-4c2657cc05b040aaa399cbb2c532cd96.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14522/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make the garlic oil: Combine 1/2 cup olive oil with minced garlic in a microwave-safe cup or bowl. Heat for 30 seconds in the microwave.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PTLl0ScvvUqNNsik03FcjL01Pv4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14522-Pizza-On-The-Grill089-step6-c8129d968bcb44b38a1e232e7ad9a49d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14522/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat an outdoor grill for high heat; brush the grate with garlic oil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the pizzas: Punch down dough and divide in half. Form each half into an oblong shape 3/8 to 1/2 inch thick.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YMsiDLHEQN9du4YWeSFgiDoKAyU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14522-Pizza-On-The-Grill092-step9-40fea257ae1f43f99d4556db7bb5f32f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14522/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully place one piece of dough on the hot grill. Dough will begin to puff almost immediately. When the bottom crust has lightly browned, turn dough over using two spatulas.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lncOsV6dPNWzP5-N0cOBRBzz9Ek=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14522-Pizza-On-The-Grill093-step10-6aec17ffdbd246fb8d7dcf283d4c3bbb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14522/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working quickly, brush garlic oil over crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7FxTK8GHEKI2qORQJYNEDNOxLhM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14522-Pizza-On-The-Grill094-step11-494736f8c5274578b4a17444e52ec24e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14522/step_11.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with 1/2 of each of the following: tomato sauce, chopped tomatoes, olives, red peppers, cheese, and basil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vl59_UAdV9o6IHJi9VQfyT-Fp0M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14522-Pizza-On-The-Grill095-step12-a69d3d4051ba4f31876e9a68db2a795b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14522/step_12.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Close the lid and cook until cheese melts. Remove from grill and set aside to cool for a few minutes. Repeat with second piece of dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IgYcoh7tziWkGqHz_cuNUT-yisI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14522-Pizza-On-The-Grill096-step13-368c7b7773e7417e82cfab673cbe1915.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14522/step_13.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aDumxyvt_wUer4D_EZTXxulVJHs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14522-Pizza-On-The-Grill100-4x3-a8027c29a77c41468ad65b0f439b0d50-64ee1fbc42414f269658585b63cf3c0f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14522/step_14.webp"
    }
  ],
